# `.agents/` is the shared source: rules, skills and templates live there and are
# committed. Per-tool directories stay local, except the symlink that points a
# tool at `.agents/skills` — that one is committed so a checkout works with no
# setup. Generate wiring for another tool with `openspec init --tools <your-tool>`.
